          </div>
          <div class="lg:col-span-2 border-t lg:border-t-0 lg:border-l border-zinc-800/80 pt-8 lg:pt-0 lg:pl-12 flex flex-col gap-4">
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">Featured Systems</p>
