                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <CheckCircle2 class="w-5 h-5 text-red-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-zinc-200 block text-sm">Sound Profile</strong>
                  <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 mt-0.5">Replaces muffled sound with a refined, aggressive acoustic signature.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <CheckCircle2 class="w-5 h-5 text-red-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-zinc-200 block text-sm">ECU Tuning</strong>
                  <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 mt-0.5">Generally not required. Retains stock fuel controllers safely.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          
          <div class="border-t border-zinc-900 pt-6">
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500">Perfect for: Street riders seeking improved sound, cleaner style, and weight reduction without remapping.</p>
